---
// src/pages/uscite/faggio-castagnata.astro - Scheda Evento Faggio Secolare
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Al Faggio Secolare: Rinfresco & Castagnata | OASY Sassello</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style is:inline>
      :root {
        --rock: #111110;
        --trail: #2d2d20;
        --energy: #c7cf0b;
        --sand: #f9f7ed;
        --water: #a5d5d7;
        --autumn: #d96919;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body {
        background-color: var(--sand);
        color: var(--rock);
        font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      .font-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }

      .ticker {
        background: var(--trail);
        color: var(--sand);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        padding: 8px 24px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 100;
      }

      header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        background: rgba(249, 247, 237, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(45, 45, 32, 0.12);
        padding: 12px 32px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        z-index: 90;
      }

      .logo-brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .logo-img {
        height: 48px;
        width: auto;
        display: block;
      }

      .back-link {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--trail);
        text-decoration: none;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(45, 45, 32, 0.06);
        transition: background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
      }

      .back-link:hover {
        background: var(--rock);
        color: var(--sand);
      }

      main {
        max-width: 1040px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 40px 24px 100px;
      }

      /* HERO USCITA CON TEXTURE SENTIERI */
      .event-hero {
        position: relative;
        background-color: var(--rock);
        color: var(--sand);
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 56px 44px;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(17, 17, 16, 0.15);
      }

      .event-hero::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image: url('/sentieri-bg.jpg'), url('/trail-network.jpg');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center right;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        opacity: 0.32;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .event-hero > * {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .event-tag {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: rgba(224, 122, 36, 0.2);
        color: #fca311;
        border: 1px solid rgba(224, 122, 36, 0.4);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
        font-weight: 900;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        line-height: 1.02;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }

      .event-intro {
        font-size: 17px;
        opacity: 0.92;
        max-width: 680px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      /* DATI RAPIDI EVENTO */
      .quick-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .stat-pill {
        background: rgba(45, 45, 32, 0.55);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
      }

      .stat-pill span {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--sand);
        opacity: 0.7;
        display: block;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      .stat-pill strong {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-top: 4px;
        display: block;
      }

      /* DETTAGLI EVENTO */
      .details-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
        gap: 36px;
        align-items: start;
        margin-bottom: 60px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 820px) {
        .details-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .event-hero { padding: 36px 24px; }
      }

      .detail-card {
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(45, 45, 32, 0.14);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 32px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(45, 45, 32, 0.04);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .detail-card h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 900;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: var(--rock);
      }

      .detail-card p {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: var(--trail);
        opacity: 0.9;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .timeline-step {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding-bottom: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(45, 45, 32, 0.08);
      }

      .timeline-step:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
        padding-bottom: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .timeline-time {
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--autumn);
        background: rgba(224, 122, 36, 0.1);
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      /* BOX ISCRIZIONE E QUOTA */
      .signup-card {
        background: var(--trail);
        color: var(--sand);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 32px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(17, 17, 16, 0.15);
        position: sticky;
        top: 90px;
      }

      .quota-price {
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: var(--energy);
        margin: 12px 0 6px;
      }

      .btn-signup {
        background: var(--energy);
        color: var(--rock);
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.8px;
        padding: 16px 28px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        text-decoration: none;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 24px;
        transition: background-color 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
      }

      .btn-signup:hover {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(45, 45, 32, 0.12);
        padding: 36px 24px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--trail);
        opacity: 0.7;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="ticker font-mono">
      <span>Sassello [SV] &bull; Beigua Geopark</span>
      <span>OASY Outdoor ASD &bull; Affiliata CSEN</span>
    </div>

    <header>
      <a href="/" class="logo-brand">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="OASY" class="logo-img" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
      </a>

      <a href="/#uscite" class="back-link">
        &larr; Torna alle Uscite
      </a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- HERO DELL'USCITA CON SFONDO SENTIERI -->
      <section class="event-hero">
        <span class="event-tag font-mono">
          AUTUNNO SUI CRINALI &bull; SABATO 8 NOVEMBRE
        </span>
        <h1>Al Faggio Secolare:<br/>Rinfresco in Quota &amp; Castagnata</h1>
        <p class="event-intro">
          Un'escursione guidata tra i boschi autunnali di Sassello per raggiungere il leggendario faggio patriarca in Bergnun. Tappa ristoro panoramica e rientro in Piazza Concezione per il terzo tempo con caldarroste, focaccette e birra artigianale.
        </p>

        <div class="quick-stats">
          <div class="stat-pill">
            <span>Distanza</span>
            <strong>11 KM</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-pill">
            <span>Dislivello</span>
            <strong>+460 M</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-pill">
            <span>Ritrovo</span>
            <strong>08:30 &bull; Partenza 09:00</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-pill">
            <span>Fondo</span>
            <strong>Bosco &amp; Sentiero</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CORPO DETTAGLI + ISCRIZIONE -->
      <div class="details-grid">
        <div>
          <!-- SCHEDA PROGRAMMA -->
          <div class="detail-card">
            <h2>Il Programma della Giornata</h2>
            
            <div class="timeline-step">
              <span class="timeline-time">08:30</span>
              <div>
                <strong style="text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 15px;">Ritrovo e accredito soci</strong>
                <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px;">Piazza Concezione a Sassello. Ritiro tazza evento OASY e briefing tracciato.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-step">
              <span class="timeline-time">09:00</span>
              <div>
                <strong style="text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 15px;">Partenza Uscita</strong>
                <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px;">Salita attraverso i boschi verso i crinali della Deiva ad andatura condivisa.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-step">
              <span class="timeline-time">11:30</span>
              <div>
                <strong style="text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 15px;">Tappa Ristoro al Faggio Secolare</strong>
                <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px;">Pausa sotto il patriarca arboreo con bevande calde e rifornimento da zaino.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-step">
              <span class="timeline-time">13:30</span>
              <div>
                <strong style="text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 15px;">Terzo Tempo in Piazza</strong>
                <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px;">Castagnata aperta, birra del Birrificio Elissor e musica fino al pomeriggio.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- COSA COMPRENDE IL PACCO GARA -->
          <div class="detail-card">
            <h2>Pacco Gara &amp; Convenzioni</h2>
            <p>Tutti gli iscritti riceveranno all'accredito:</p>
            <ul style="padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--trail); line-height: 1.8;">
              <li><strong>Tazza smaltata OASY con moschettone</strong> (da agganciare allo zaino per i rifornimenti).</li>
              <li><strong>Buono sconto di 5&euro;</strong> spendibile presso la bottega e officina <em>Outsider Sassello</em>.</li>
              <li>Rinfresco in quota al patriarca arboreo.</li>
              <li>Cartoccio di caldarroste compreso all'arrivo.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- BOX ISCRIZIONE E QUOTA -->
        <aside class="signup-card">
          <span class="font-mono" style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; opacity: 0.7;">
            ISCRIZIONI APERTE
          </span>
          <div class="quota-price font-mono">12&euro; / 15&euro;</div>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.85; line-height: 1.5;">
            <strong>12&euro;</strong> per i soci OASY tesserati CSEN.<br/>
            <strong>15&euro;</strong> per i non tesserati (include copertura assicurativa giornaliera).
          </p>

<a href="/iscrizione-uscita?evento=faggio" class="btn-signup">
  <span>Iscrizione Rapida Uscita &rarr;</span>
</a>

          <div style="margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.75; line-height: 1.5;">
            &bull; Posti limitati per la salvaguardia del sentiero.<br/>
            &bull; Traccia GPX inviata via email 48h prima.
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      &copy; OASY ASD &bull; Outdoor Activity Sassello &amp; You &bull; Affiliata CSEN
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>